category: Libs
requires: cygwin libev4 libltdl7 libunserding2
sdesc: "Framework for ad-hoc networks for financial applications (utilities)"
ldesc: "Unserding is a simple pub-sub messaging library, much like 0mq or nanomsg,
without all the transports they support and without the reliability promise,
made for heavy-duty realtime delivery of time series."

